{"hw":"νεότης","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">νεότης</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">νεότης</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Dor.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">νέο-τας</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ητος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">νέος</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">youth,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἐκ νεότητος.. ἐς γῆρας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.86</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ev.Marc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.20</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἀτέμβονται νεότητος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">23.445</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐρατὴν γὰρ ἀπωλέσαμεν νεότητα,</span> i.e. we died young, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Simon.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">89</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HF</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">637</span> </span> (lyr.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">149</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐν νεότατι, ἐπὶ νεότητος,</span> in one's <b class=\"lex-tr\">youth,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Sapph.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.3</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">V.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1199</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ach.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">214</span> </span>: in pl., <span class=\"gk\">αἱ ν. ἄφρονες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.359</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Posidipp.</span> </span> or <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.Com.</span> </span> or Crates); <span class=\"gk\">αἱ ν. ῥωμαλέαι</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">360</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Metrod.</span> </span>). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">youthful spirit, impetuosity,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.13</span> </span>: in bad sense, <b class=\"lex-tr\">youthful folly, insolence,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἀκολασίᾳ καὶ ν.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">26e</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ν. καὶ ἄνοια</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.7</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> collective, = νεολαία, <b class=\"lex-tr\">body of youth,</b> esp. of military or athletic age, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">I.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8(7).75</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.3</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.12</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.8</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> in Crete, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">νεότας</span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἁ,</span> acc. <span class=\"gk\">νεότα,</span> gen. <span class=\"gk\">νεότας,</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">board of officials representing the</b> <span class=\"gk\">νέοι</span> (cf. <span class=\"gk\">νέος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.1</span> </span> ), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">GDI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5012.6</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">525.9</span> </span> (Gortyn, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iii B.C.</span>).</div></div>"}